A '''starport''' was located on [[Glavis Ringworld]] during the [[New Republic Era]]. [[Star Liner Travel]]'s [[Flight 1020]] ran a non-stop service from Glavis Ringworld to [[Tatooine]], and used [[gate number one]] in the starport. An announcer was used to communicate boarding announcements to customers.<ref name="Return" />
